.IX Title "LEI-REINDEX 1"
.TH LEI-REINDEX 1 1993-10-02 public-inbox.git "public-inbox user manual"
.\" For nroff, turn off justification.  Always turn off hyphenation; it makes
.\" way too many mistakes in technical documents.
.if n .ad l
.nh
.SH "نام (NAME)"
lei\-reindex \- reindex messages already in lei/store
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.IX Header "SYNOPSIS"
lei reindex [OPTIONS]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.IX Header "DESCRIPTION"
Forces a re\-index of all messages previously\-indexed by \fBlei\-import\fR\|(1)
or \fBlei\-index\fR\|(1).  This can be used for in\-place upgrades and bugfixes
while other processes are querying the store.  Keep in mind this roughly
doubles the size of the already\-large Xapian database.
.PP
It does not re\-index messages in externals, using the \f(CW\*(C`\-\-reindex\*(C'\fR
switch of \fBpublic\-inbox\-index\fR\|(1) or \fBpublic\-inbox\-extindex\fR\|(1) is
needed for that.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.IX Header "OPTIONS"
.IP \-q 4
.IX Item "-q"
.PD 0
.IP \-\-quiet 4
.IX Item "--quiet"
.PD
Suppress feedback messages.
.SH CONTACT
.IX Header "CONTACT"
Feedback welcome via plain\-text mail to <mailto:meta@public\-inbox.org>
.PP
The mail archives are hosted at <https://public\-inbox.org/meta> and
<http://4uok3hntl7oi7b4uf4rtfwefqeexfzil2w6kgk2jn5z2f764irre7byd.onion/meta>
